# Fanatical Firebrand's ability targets Bot2's Elvish Mystic. In response Bot2 Lightning Bolts its own Mystic, so on resolution the
# only target is illegal and the ability does not resolve (CR 608.2b): nothing is dealt - Bot2's life stays 20. The Firebrand was
# sacrificed as a cost (CR 602.2b), so it is in the graveyard regardless. Control: the scenario where the Mystic is still there.

